    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a large stockpot over medium-high heat. Sauté celery and onion in hot butter until slightly softened.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oOllsNRkmpbyDlb4dVvCywMyurU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8562-chicken-noodle-soup-DDMFS-step-02-1366-e057b557dcbb467e905ab9f5fc726503.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8562/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add water, chicken, bouillon, carrots, parsley, marjoram, pepper, and bay leaf. Simmer for 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ji9PsN89EnpdWybzsmOr_h-lPw0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8562-chicken-noodle-soup-DDMFS-step-03-1367-076903e8a9a74605a000cfe35a4d3a99.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8562/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in noodles and simmer until pasta is tender, about 10 more minutes.",
